  "text": "This soft beige top paired with the matching wide-leg trousers creates a gentle, relaxed silhouette perfect for a casual autumn day. The blush loafers add a delicate touch of femininity without being too formal, while the pearl-adorned headband introduces a hint of playful elegance to complete your look. The peach handbag brings warmth and texture, balancing the neutral tones with its vibrant pop of color.",
  "how_to_wear": "Keep the top untucked to highlight the defined waistline and maintain a streamlined silhouette. Wear the loafers flat for comfort while walking through the park.",
